@startuml
actor Caller
participant "ScriptSigningController" as API
participant "DigiCertScriptSigningService" as Service
participant "Jsign" as Jsign
participant "DigiCert ONE / KeyLocker" as DigiCert
participant "RFC3161 TSA" as TSA

Caller -> API: POST /api/v1/scripts/sign
API -> Service: sign(fileName, scriptContent)
Service -> Service: validate + create temp .ps1
Service -> Jsign: sign(Signable)
Jsign -> DigiCert: remote private-key signature
DigiCert --> Jsign: signature value
Jsign -> TSA: timestamp request
TSA --> Jsign: timestamp token
Jsign --> Service: signed file
Service -> Service: read signed content + delete temp file
Service --> API: signed response
API --> Caller: 200 signed script
@enduml
